WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.826
Quick update is for the
jobs that cannot wait.

2
00:00:02.826 --> 00:00:06.153
On a phone, open the menu
and choose Quick update.

3
00:00:06.153 --> 00:00:09.881
Each big button is one job, a few taps each.

4
00:00:09.881 --> 00:00:11.863
Try the first one: put up a notice.

5
00:00:11.863 --> 00:00:16.627
Type the notice in one or two sentences.

6
00:00:16.627 --> 00:00:20.356
The notice is on the
website in a few minutes.

7
00:00:20.356 --> 00:00:25.067
It takes itself down on
the last day you pick.
